{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a point &amp; click time management game that puts your multi-tasking to the test. Use the computer and other gadgets around the tower to complete your nightly checklist.<br>But watch out! The research subjects from the lab below tend to wander a bit at night. Use all methods at your disposal to dissuade them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all of your tasks before sunrise or <u><strong>YOU'RE FIRED!</strong></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Congratulations on your new position as a watchtower attendant!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On behalf of the Eclipse Research Foundation, <i><strong>welcome to our family!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your role is vital in securing, and protecting, our state-of-the-art research facility. Nightly duties will consist of stimulating, and engaging, tasks such as:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Answering phone calls!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388420/extras/41708f105eb2e8b07e49a541995561a1.poster.avif?t=1767732685\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388420/extras/41708f105eb2e8b07e49a541995561a1.webm?t=1767732685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388420/extras/41708f105eb2e8b07e49a541995561a1.mp4?t=1767732685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Checking your email!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388420/extras/0c94d7233137ac07da6a7ea8743cea7e.poster.avif?t=1767732685\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388420/extras/0c94d7233137ac07da6a7ea8743cea7e.webm?t=1767732685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388420/extras/0c94d7233137ac07da6a7ea8743cea7e.mp4?t=1767732685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Updating software!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388420/extras/6fa1e5f50b395f6f81e968c1d56161b4.poster.avif?t=1767732685\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388420/extras/6fa1e5f50b395f6f81e968c1d56161b4.webm?t=1767732685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388420/extras/6fa1e5f50b395f6f81e968c1d56161b4.mp4?t=1767732685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle reminder: All required tasks must be complete by 8:00AM, <u><i><strong>no exceptions</strong></i></u>. <i>Failure will result in immediate termination.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here at the Eclipse Research Foundation, our mission is pushing the human-limit to its maximum potential. Although our research team is comprised of the best &amp; brightest, breakthrough experimentation can have unpredictable results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you detect any subjects in your tower, simply follow the <i><strong>ARM</strong></i> protocol:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A</strong> \u2014 Alarm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>R </strong>\u2014 Report</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>M\u0338\u0340\u0317\u0330\u032a\u033c\u0349</strong> \u0334\u0311\u0300\u030a\u0302\u0318\u0331\u0331-\u0338\u0309\u0314\u0304\u035c\u0316\u031f\u034d\u0353-\u0335\u0308\u030d\u030d\u033c\u0339\u0345\u033a\u0333 \u0337\u035d\u0328\u0349\u0348.\u0334\u034a\u033d\u0341\u033f\u0333\u032a\u0330\u035a/\u0338\u0312\u033c\u0345\u031c`\u0334\u033f\u0323~\u0336\u0314\u0341\u0306\u032e\u0332\u0327\u034e\u0353</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Under no circumstance should ANY unauthorized employee interact with  subjects. Failure to comply will result in immediate termination. </i></strong><i>If you suspect any personnel of interacting with subjects, report it to your supervisor<u> immediately.</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know you'll be a perfect fit on our team! On behalf of everyone at the Eclipse Research Foundation, we welcome you!<br>And always remember, <i>Don't Forget the Phone</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a9 20XX Eclipse Research Foundation </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3388420?t=1767732685","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388420/f948833c9c195f677c99d221e8f6876b6df4ce72/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767732685","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388420/1aec2e148c61cee7f4d6bfeaf815b4970655cd5c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767732685","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388420/1aec2e148c61cee7f4d6bfeaf815b4970655cd5c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767732685","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: General Mature Content"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a point &amp; click time management game that puts your multi-tasking to the test. Use the computer and other gadgets around the tower to complete your nightly checklist.<br>But watch out! The research subjects from the lab below tend to wander a bit at night. Use all methods at your disposal to dissuade them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all of your tasks before sunrise or <u><strong>YOU'RE FIRED!</strong></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Congratulations on your new position as a watchtower attendant!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On behalf of the Eclipse Research Foundation, <i><strong>welcome to our family!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your role is vital in securing, and protecting, our state-of-the-art research facility. Nightly duties will consist of stimulating, and engaging, tasks such as:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Answering phone calls!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388420/extras/41708f105eb2e8b07e49a541995561a1.poster.avif?t=1767732685\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388420/extras/41708f105eb2e8b07e49a541995561a1.webm?t=1767732685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388420/extras/41708f105eb2e8b07e49a541995561a1.mp4?t=1767732685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Checking your email!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388420/extras/0c94d7233137ac07da6a7ea8743cea7e.poster.avif?t=1767732685\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388420/extras/0c94d7233137ac07da6a7ea8743cea7e.webm?t=1767732685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388420/extras/0c94d7233137ac07da6a7ea8743cea7e.mp4?t=1767732685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Updating software!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388420/extras/6fa1e5f50b395f6f81e968c1d56161b4.poster.avif?t=1767732685\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388420/extras/6fa1e5f50b395f6f81e968c1d56161b4.webm?t=1767732685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388420/extras/6fa1e5f50b395f6f81e968c1d56161b4.mp4?t=1767732685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle reminder: All required tasks must be complete by 8:00AM, <u><i><strong>no exceptions</strong></i></u>. <i>Failure will result in immediate termination.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here at the Eclipse Research Foundation, our mission is pushing the human-limit to its maximum potential. Although our research team is comprised of the best &amp; brightest, breakthrough experimentation can have unpredictable results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you detect any subjects in your tower, simply follow the <i><strong>ARM</strong></i> protocol:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A</strong> \u2014 Alarm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>R </strong>\u2014 Report</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>M\u0338\u0340\u0317\u0330\u032a\u033c\u0349</strong> \u0334\u0311\u0300\u030a\u0302\u0318\u0331\u0331-\u0338\u0309\u0314\u0304\u035c\u0316\u031f\u034d\u0353-\u0335\u0308\u030d\u030d\u033c\u0339\u0345\u033a\u0333 \u0337\u035d\u0328\u0349\u0348.\u0334\u034a\u033d\u0341\u033f\u0333\u032a\u0330\u035a/\u0338\u0312\u033c\u0345\u031c`\u0334\u033f\u0323~\u0336\u0314\u0341\u0306\u032e\u0332\u0327\u034e\u0353</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Under no circumstance should ANY unauthorized employee interact with  subjects. Failure to comply will result in immediate termination. </i></strong><i>If you suspect any personnel of interacting with subjects, report it to your supervisor<u> immediately.</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know you'll be a perfect fit on our team! On behalf of everyone at the Eclipse Research Foundation, we welcome you!<br>And always remember, <i>Don't Forget the Phone</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a9 20XX Eclipse Research Foundation </p>","developers":["Jaxkey","Sandhill Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388420/header.jpg?t=1767732685","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3388420/796289/3920a002ca600613d30730493d723cd48e040df5/1750846347/dash_av1.mpd?t=1734555412","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3388420/796289/3920a002ca600613d30730493d723cd48e040df5/1750846347/dash_h264.mpd?t=1734555412","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3388420/796289/3920a002ca600613d30730493d723cd48e040df5/1750846347/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1734555412","id":257079724,"name":"Don't Forget the Phone \u2014 Official Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257079724/e3b0398fd0c86bbde6c3abf19a1527ea13acec34/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1734555412"}],"name":"Don't Forget the Phone","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Sandhill Software"],"ratin